[{"title":"Top of page","items":[{"id":"98fb60","kind":"WhatsApp message","value":"Hi Digitorium, I want to talk about a project."},{"id":"ad04a2","kind":"Address","value":"10 Mangalmay Complex, Maninagar, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380008"},{"id":"42b81e","kind":"Question and answer","value":"What should I send before the first call?"},{"id":"336c34","kind":"Question and answer","value":"The link to your site or access to your ad account, and one line on what is not working. That is enough for us to look before we talk."},{"id":"f2d65a","kind":"Question and answer","value":"Do you charge for the audit?"},{"id":"3cea59","kind":"Question and answer","value":"No. We tell you what is leaking, in writing, before any money changes hands. If we cannot help, we will say so."},{"id":"011783","kind":"Question and answer","value":"Do you work with clients outside Ahmedabad?"},{"id":"4d740b","kind":"Question and answer","value":"Yes. Around a third of the work is for clients abroad, including Canada and the Congo. Most of it runs over calls and WhatsApp. Shoots need us on location."},{"id":"1acfd8","kind":"Question and answer","value":"Can I visit the office?"},{"id":"faf62d","kind":"Question and answer","value":"Yes. Message us first and we will fix a time, so the person doing your work is there."},{"id":"7f7d52","kind":"Ways to reach us · k","value":"WhatsApp"},{"id":"879830","kind":"Ways to reach us · v","value":"+91 786 198 2524"},{"id":"baeb88","kind":"Ways to reach us · note","value":"The fastest way to reach us"},{"id":"d46786","kind":"Ways to reach us · k","value":"Call"},{"id":"879830-2","kind":"Ways to reach us · v","value":"+91 786 198 2524"},{"id":"3bd414","kind":"Ways to reach us · note","value":"Talk to the person doing the work"},{"id":"2a8e7a","kind":"Ways to reach us · href","value":"tel:+917861982524"},{"id":"f0cdf1","kind":"Ways to reach us · k","value":"Email"},{"id":"a96dc0","kind":"Ways to reach us · v","value":"info@digitorium.in"},{"id":"1bbd37","kind":"Ways to